# --------------------------------------------------
# AIEMS Exchange Bridge (EBG-0057, EIP-ESR0025-001)
# Local Claude<->Codex handover state - never shared/committed. Convention-
# only protection against other repository content (kept out of version
# control by this entry); scripts/aiems_bridge.py additionally restricts
# filesystem permissions on this directory at creation on POSIX systems
# (EBG-0086, ESR-0033 WP4) - this is not an enforced guarantee on Windows,
# where standard chmod bits do not restrict other local accounts.
# --------------------------------------------------
.aiems-exchange/

# --------------------------------------------------
# Local secrets (EBG-0088, ESR-0033 WP4)
# No .env file is tracked or expected today - every credential in this
# codebase is a CredentialReference to an environment variable name, never
# a value in source (confirmed by external security review, 19 July 2026).
# This is a standing guard against a future accidental `git add .env`.
# --------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*

# --------------------------------------------------
# Backend sidecar build scratch (EIP-ESR0032-001)
# scripts/build_backend_sidecar.py's own PyInstaller work directory -
# the packaged output itself lives in src-tauri/binaries/, ignored
# separately by src-tauri/.gitignore.
# --------------------------------------------------
.sidecar-build/
